		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet restore Configuration Template PG
		|configurationName|AP Manual Display|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Manual No Assets Message PG
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Restored Setup PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	Then AssetPublisherPortlet delete Configuration Template PG
		|configurationName|AP Manual Display|